WEBVTT

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.520
<i>Reppuzan!</i>

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.700
You did it, Sakamoto-san!

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:20.580
You defeated it, Major!

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.450
Yeah.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.330
Major? Is something wrong?

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.540
No. I'm fine.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:46.310
<i>Have I exhausted my magic power?</i>

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.510
Sakamoto-san! It's Miyafuji.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.470
I have a message
from Commander Minna.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.220
Saka-

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:44.890
Sakamoto-san?

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:46.640
Huh?

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.190
Could she still be practicing?

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.440
Reppumaru...

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.530
I'm trying to learn a Reppuzan that'll top Reppuzan...

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.780
The "True Reppuzan."

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.240
True Reppuzan?

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.540
Yes. It's a secret technique passed down

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.540
in the Fuso Empire
since time immemorial.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.750
If I'm able to master it,

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:15.420
I'll be able to obliterate even the strongest Neuroi in one strike.

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:31.100
Incredible... So this is the Reppumaru.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:37.860
Miyafuji!

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:41.400
Snap out of it, Miyafuji!

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:45.240
Sakamoto-san?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.160
Oh, good. Can you stand?

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.540
Y-Yes.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:55.380
U-Uh, Sakamoto-san, that sword...

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:56.290
You fool!

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:59.710
Don't you <i>ever</i> touch this
sword again! Understood?

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.260
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:03.470
I apologize.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.570
They left.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.110
What are they taking the plane for?

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.450
There's an important
meeting at mission control.

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:24.660
Sakamoto-san and Commander Minna are going to it.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.410
I see.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:31.000
I feel like that's the first time Sakamoto-san's lashed out at me in quite a while.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.370
Ah, there you are!

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:34.420
Hey!

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:38.340
Come here, you two!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.840
In we go!

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:56.730
Why're we all taking a
bath so early in the day?

00:04:56.730 --> 00:05:00.360
Captain Barkhorn told us to take this chance to refresh ourselves.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.950
This might be the last time
we get to use this bath.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:04.900
Huh?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.950
Minna and the Major went to mission control, right?

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:11.040
It's likely they're about to
issue the final attack orders.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.160
It's scary to think about.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:14.040
The final attack orders?

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:17.580
Yeah. We'll head for the
Neuroi hive over Venezia,

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.960
and wage an all-out attack.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.050
What's the meaning of this?!

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.260
General, you're saying the Witches won't be needed

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:28.590
in the upcoming campaign?

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:31.010
Not at all.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:35.640
I'm saying the Witches aren't the <i>key</i> in defeating the Neuroi hive.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:38.060
That's all.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:41.320
We're up against the hive;
things are different.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:48.240
Has the 501st Joint Fighter Wing
ever defeated a Neuroi hive directly?

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.910
Well, no, but...

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:56.620
Lieutenant Colonel Minna, we've already determined the upcoming mission.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.000
Isn't that right, Captain Sugita?

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.130
That's correct.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:04.630
I shall repel the Venezian
Neuroi hive myself,

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:08.300
by using the Fuso
naval battleship, Yamato.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.220
Captain!

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:12.430
For all the Yamato's strengths,
she's just a conventional weapon.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.770
I do not believe she can
defeat an airborne Neuroi hive.

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:19.480
She's no conventional weapon, Major.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:24.980
She's our ultimate weapon.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.820
Ultimate weapon?

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.740
Yes.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:34.620
From the Warlock research the Fuso navy conducted in Gallia,

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:39.330
we developed an extremely stable core control system.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.920
Though it can only last for ten minutes,

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.920
we're able to convert her into

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.260
a Neuroi while suppressing its tendency to go berserk.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.880
Convert the Yamato into a Neuroi?

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:50.590
Have you lost your mind?

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:53.970
It takes a Neuroi to
defeat the Neuroi.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:56.600
Defeating a Neuroi hive is
beyond the Witches' abilities.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.100
There's nothing a Witch can't do!

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:04.650
As long as I have the True Reppuzan, even against a Neuroi hive,

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:05.860
I swear to you I will win!

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.860
Major Sakamoto...

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:14.280
Aren't you past retirement age?

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:18.120
If we lose this battle,

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:22.920
we'll have no choice but to surrender all of Romagna.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:28.090
It would then go without saying we
could not leave the 501st as it is now.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:29.880
Do you get what I am saying?

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:32.590
This meeting is adjourned.

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:36.470
Operation Mars begins
at 1000 hours tomorrow.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:37.600
General!

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.230
Stop, Major Sakamoto.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:40.850
Minna!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:47.480
Have the 501st Joint Fighter Wing escort the Yamato into battle.

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:50.280
Understood.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:01.790
We shall strike the Neuroi
hive with all we have

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.080
and destroy it in one battle.

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:06.960
And that wraps up
our final battle plans.

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:09.170
And what if it doesn't work?

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:14.840
Then we'll have to surrender Romagna to the Neuroi

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:18.350
and disband the 501st Joint Fighter Wing.

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:22.940
Surrender?! Disband the 501st?!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.520
That's ridiculous!

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:27.520
Minna! You just agreed to this?!

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.190
Of course not!

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:33.610
I'm as against this as you are.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:39.540
But we don't have the resources to continue this war of attrition.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:43.580
Casualties will just pile
up if we continue fighting.

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:47.630
This is our only option.

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:49.250
Surrender...

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:50.920
...Romagna?

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:52.130
This can't be...

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:06.100
It'll be fine. Don't be so worried.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:09.020
There's no way we'll hand your homeland over to the Neuroi.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.860
We just need to win.

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:12.820
Y-Yeah! We just need to win!

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.240
Exactly.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.490
Yes, let's win!

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:16.490
I know we'll win!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.780
The girls are right, Trude.

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.490
So why're you acting so weak?

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:22.830
I-I'm not!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:25.790
I will fight until I'm the last one standing!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.790
I won't let you be alone out there.

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:32.800
There are eleven members
of the Strike Witches!

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.050
Yeah!

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:36.050
With the eleven of us,
I know we can win!

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:43.930
Eleven, huh?

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:01.700
<i>Sakamoto-san seemed strange today.</i>

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:07.790
<i>I can still see Reppumaru's
effects on my hands.</i>

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:14.760
Sakamoto-san, are you
awake? Sakamoto-san?

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:18.430
Sakamoto-san?

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:41.910
<i>Tonight's the night.</i>

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:45.870
<i>I must master the True
Reppuzan by sun-up.</i>

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.250
<i>Spin, damn it!</i>

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:07.430
Minna... You knew?

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.940
I knew it'd come to this someday.

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:13.610
I see.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:17.190
It's a double-edged sword...

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:19.950
In exchange for strength on the battlefield,

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:23.410
that magical sword eats up
a great deal of your magic power.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:30.040
Reppumaru is shortening
your life span as a Witch.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.670
I can still fight!

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.380
It's over, Mio!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:42.890
It's not!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:46.600
I swear I will master
the True Reppuzan!

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:47.680
No!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:49.850
Can't you see?! It's impossible!

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:51.190
Please!

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:53.600
Please, just once! Just one attack!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:57.110
Let me perform a True Reppuzan!

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:03.110
Please... Let me...

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:07.410
Let me be one of the eleven!

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:11.410
I'm begging you... Minna...

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:18.630
Mio...

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:35.400
I had no idea... Sakamoto-san...

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:42.950
Momentarily, the 501st Joint Fighter Wing

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:45.030
will be leaving the base
to eradicate the Neuroi

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.910
in Operation Mars.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:53.120
Our mission is to escort and protect
the Allied navy's flagship, the Yamato.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.620
Everyone, depart!

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.580
Roger!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:10.180
Let's do our best, Yoshika-chan.

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:10.760
Yeah.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:15.770
<i>That's right. I need to work extra
hard to make up for Sakamoto-san.</i>

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:19.440
<i>If I do that, then she
won't need to fight!</i>

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:36.370
Look! Witches!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:36.870
Oh!

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:38.000
It's the Strike Witches!

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:44.670
So that's the Yamato.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.180
It's huge!

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:51.140
I see it.

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:51.720
Yes.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:53.850
I can see it.

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:54.850
Yoshika-chan.

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:55.730
Yeah.

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.610
That's the Neuroi's hive.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:04.570
That's right.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:06.480
That's our final opponent.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.960
We'll soon be entering Venezia.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.760
We'll be behind enemy lines.

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:27.760
Three minutes until the Yamato's Neuroification!

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.090
Destroyer Nicholas hit!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:33.430
All hands to battle formation!

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:38.770
It's begun.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:42.230
We must protect the Yamato until her Neuroification is complete.

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:43.480
Roger!

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.740
Yoshika-chan!

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:56.080
So powerful...

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.670
They're focusing their
attack on the Yamato.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:03.880
Did they figure out the
Yamato isn't a normal ship?

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.090
Get over here, Lucchini!

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:17.140
We did it!

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.640
Over here! Here!

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:19.890
Yoo-hoo!

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:21.980
Sanya!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.060
Yeah.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:28.780
But I only shot once.

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:30.740
Incredible, Sanya!

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:32.780
Come on! Come on!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.410
Their numbers aren't
going down at all.

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:37.540
Shut up and shoot.

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.120
Just pretend there's a medal waiting on the other side!

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.790
I don't care about that!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.460
Damn it. They just keep coming.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.460
Get the hell out of Romagna!

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.800
Yoshika-chan, are you okay?

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.760
Yeah. I'm fine.

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:56.640
<i>I have to give it my all. If I do that...</i>

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:02.140
Are you all right, Major?

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.690
This is nothing!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.440
Miyafuji and the others
are working their butts off.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:07.320
There is no way
I'm losing out here!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.490
Anti-Neuroi anti-air shells...

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:15.660
All ships, fire!

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:29.800
We're surrounded!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.630
Lynne-chan! Perrine-san!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:34.590
Over my dead body!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.840
Sakamoto-san!

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:36.680
Major!

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:39.970
<i>Reppuzan!</i>

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.330
Are you okay, Sakamoto-san?

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:06.630
<i>My magic power... My Reppuzan... They aren't working.</i>

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.670
11 000 units from the target.

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:14.550
Thirty seconds until Neuroification.

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:16.550
Magic engine dynamo ready to go.

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:22.680
Show them what happens
when you piss off mankind.

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:23.980
Twenty seconds left...

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:24.980
Nineteen.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:25.770
Eighteen.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.310
Damn it!

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:31.400
Hang in there, Lucchini!

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.650
It ain't over yet!

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:34.990
I guess we have no choice.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.780
Are you all right, Lynne-san?

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.160
Y-Yes!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.370
Anyone who has been depleted of magic power,

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:44.620
retreat to the aircraft carrier, Amagi.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.830
I can no longer fight?

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:52.590
I can no longer protect people?

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:57.590
Four, three, two, one...

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:58.470
Zero!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:01.510
Fire up the revised core control system!

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:03.270
Starting magic engine dynamo!

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.200
Did they start?

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:20.070
It looks like it.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:21.870
Eila, look.

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:24.370
Wow, it's really turning into a Neuroi.

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.760
Neuroification of the Yamato complete.

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:38.220
Approximately nine
minutes of usage remain.

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:39.970
Take the Yamato to the skies!

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.800
The Yamato's flying?

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:20.720
All systems stable.

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.340
It worked.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:26.640
Holy cow!

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:28.100
Sanya, look at that!

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.230
I already am.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.850
Sight set for the enemy Neuroi.

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:33.560
En route to target!

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:35.020
Stay the course.

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:36.980
Yamato, full speed ahead!

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.440
Mission complete.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:41.860
Everyone return to the
aircraft carrier, Amagi.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:48.950
Major, we succeeded in our mission.

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:53.960
For me, "living" and "fighting" were one and the same.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:59.800
And yet now I lost my shield,
and can't use the Reppuzan...

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:04.390
You fought valiantly.

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:13.100
<i>This is great. Now
Sakamoto-san won't need to fight.</i>

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.580
They're going to be defeated!

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:32.120
No, they will be fine.
They are regenerating.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.880
This is the power of Neuroification...

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:39.340
Yes! The Neuroified Yamato is invincible!

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.050
1000 units to the Neuroi hive!

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:49.310
Five-hundred!

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:51.220
Such incredible firepower.

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:52.390
Three-hundred!

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:57.190
Charge!

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.950
Now! Fire the main cannon!

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:06.740
Fire!

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.580
Victory is ours.

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:19.840
Wh-Why aren't they firing?

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:21.210
This can't be!

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:24.300
Captain! The artillery control system is nonoperational!

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:25.630
What?!

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:27.890
The magic engine dynamo
has stopped moving.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.010
It's no good! The main
cannon can't be fired!

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:32.350
This is a disaster!

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:50.280
Captain...

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:54.250
We've done all we can.

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:57.960
Everyone, you fought bravely.

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:01.460
However, the Yamato's magic
engine dynamo is nonoperational,

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:03.090
and the main cannon cannot be fired.

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:05.720
Our operation has failed.

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:07.510
Failed?!

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:09.680
This can't be... We're going to lose?

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:10.930
No way!

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:11.970
Is this really happening?

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:15.560
Sakamoto-san...

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:18.560
All ships, alter course
in succession sixteen points,

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:20.440
preserving order of the fleet.

00:22:20.810 --> 00:22:21.400
No!

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:23.690
It's not over yet!

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:27.150
It's not over. Not this war...

00:22:27.150 --> 00:22:28.740
Nor I!

00:22:29.450 --> 00:22:29.990
Mio!

00:22:30.530 --> 00:22:32.160
I will board the Yamato

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:35.620
and start the magic engine
dynamo with my magic power!

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:36.660
Mio, no!

00:22:37.160 --> 00:22:38.960
Sakamoto-san!

00:24:12.680 --> 00:24:15.050
Our dream may seem far away,

00:24:15.050 --> 00:24:16.510
but together, we can make it come true,

00:24:16.510 --> 00:24:17.680
with our insurmountable courage!

00:24:18.260 --> 00:24:21.980
Next time on <i>Strike Witches 2,</i>
the final episode:

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:23.730
Beyond the Skies to Eternity.
